    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "session_text",
      "x": 421.6666564941406,
      "y": 104.58331298828125,
      "width": 264.2578125,
      "height": 192.5,
      "text": "  SessionMemory/ — Per-Session Extraction\n\n  Trigger: Dual threshold\n   (tokens + tool calls) OR\n   (tokens + no tools in last turn)\n\n  Execution: Forked subagent\n   (doesn't block main conversation)\n   Sequential: one at a time\n\n  Output: Files with 0o600 permissions\n   (user-readable only)\n\n  Lifetime: Session-scoped",
      "originalText": "  SessionMemory/ — Per-Session Extraction\n\n  Trigger: Dual threshold\n   (tokens + tool calls) OR\n   (tokens + no tools in last turn)\n\n  Execution: Forked subagent\n   (doesn't block main conversation)\n   Sequential: one at a time\n\n  Output: Files with 0o600 permissions\n   (user-readable only)\n\n  Lifetime: Session-scoped",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
