    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "dream_text",
      "x": 49.00006103515625,
      "y": 326.125,
      "width": 335.15625,
      "height": 233.75,
      "text": "    autoDream/ — Background Consolidation\n    \n    3-Gate System (cheapest first):\n    \n      Gate 1: TIME (file stat, μs)\n        Has enough time passed?\n          ↓ yes\n      Gate 2: SESSIONS (counter, ns)\n        Enough sessions since last dream?\n          ↓ yes\n      Gate 3: LOCK (filesystem, ms)\n        No other process dreaming?\n          ↓ acquired\n      Fork subprocess → /dream command\n    \n    Bash: READ-ONLY during dreams\n    Failure: Rewinds lock mtime (retry next session)",
      "originalText": "    autoDream/ — Background Consolidation\n    \n    3-Gate System (cheapest first):\n    \n      Gate 1: TIME (file stat, μs)\n        Has enough time passed?\n          ↓ yes\n      Gate 2: SESSIONS (counter, ns)\n        Enough sessions since last dream?\n          ↓ yes\n      Gate 3: LOCK (filesystem, ms)\n        No other process dreaming?\n          ↓ acquired\n      Fork subprocess → /dream command\n    \n    Bash: READ-ONLY during dreams\n    Failure: Rewinds lock mtime (retry next session)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
